---
Fix C99 vs C11 standard mismatch.

Some files use C11 features (atomics, static_assert) while the project
targets C99. Either upgrade to C11 or provide C99 fallbacks.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Consistent C standard across all targets (C11 recommended)
- [ ] CMakeLists.txt sets CMAKE_C_STANDARD consistently
- [ ] All files compile cleanly with chosen standard
- [ ] Atomic operations use correct headers (<stdatomic.h> for C11)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build with -std=c11 -pedantic, verify no warnings
- [ ] Build with both GCC and Clang, verify clean compilation
